==Description==
'''Primordial Drakobloxxer''', which uses a speaker name of '''???''' and was internally referred to as '''HiddenDog''', was a narrator that appears in [[Containment]]. It was [[Primordial Drakobloxxer]] from the [[Hexscape Event]].

==Appearance==
'''Primordial Drakobloxxer''' was a large creature with  red spikes on its body. It was covered entirely in darkness. It had eight arms, each with four claws. It used six of them to support itself while walking and the other two to hold and control a [[God Cube]] shard. Its head was a large mouth with no visible eyes.

