==Trivia==
*The neutral animation was only used on the final wave prior to the final wave cutscene being added. This means that it could only be seen in the actual game for less than a few hours.
**Because of this, '''Primordial Drakobloxxer''' was mainly seen through its far away animation, where its model never appears.

